<div class="container">
  <div class="box install">
    <h2><a href="docs#install-it">Install</a></h2>

Quick installation instructions.

```bash
npm i -D mdsvex@next
```

```bash
pnpm add -D mdsvex@next
```

  </div>
  <div class="box use">
    <h2><a href="docs#use-it">Use</a></h2>

Add mdsvex to your Vite config

```js
plugins: [
  mdsvex(config),
  sveltekit()
]
```
  </div>
