  <div class="box layouts">
    <h2><a href="docs#templates-1">Templates</a></h2>

Wrap mdsvex documents in components.

<h3><a href="docs#choosing-a-template">named templates</a></h3>

Pick a template by name.

```svx
---
template: blog
---
```

<h3><a href="docs#opting-out">opting out</a></h3>

Render a document without one.

```svx
---
template: false
---
```

<h3><a href="docs#custom-components">custom components</a></h3>

<p class="keep">Replace HTML elements with custom components.</p>

  </div>

  <div class="box frontmatter">
    <h2><a href="docs#frontmatter-1">Frontmatter</a></h2>

Frontmatter is exported as metadata.

```mdsvex
---
title: Fabuloso
---

# {metadata.title}
```

  </div>

